{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 45,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.173309326171875,
        326.3909912109375,
        73.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "5.7\t Antibiotics for treatment of necrotizing enterocolitis",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.79890441894531,
        399.0327453613281,
        90.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "Young neonates with suspected necrotizing enterocolitis (NEC) should be treated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        89.79890441894531,
        399.0928039550781,
        103.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "with IV or IM ampicillin (or penicillin) and gentamicin as a first line antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        102.79890441894531,
        146.8129119873047,
        116.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "treatment for 10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        118.20362091064453,
        264.8629150390625,
        132.12362670898438
      ],
      "text": "(Standard recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        142.96212768554688,
        91.77291107177734,
        155.1021270751953
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        155.9721221923828,
        399.1227722167969,
        169.46212768554688
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that it has been common practice to add metronidazole to the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        168.9720916748047,
        399.0828857421875,
        182.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "treatment of NEC. Although there is no evidence to judge its benefits, metronidazole",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        181.8420867919922,
        399.10003662109375,
        195.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "Bacteroides fragilus covers gastrointestinal tract anaerobic bacteria (such as  ). It also",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        194.9720916748047,
        399.0329284667969,
        208.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "noted that while a combination of vancomycin and ceftriaxone is a suitable alternative,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.9720916748047,
        399.0230407714844,
        221.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "the only evidence is from tertiary western intensive care units. Vancomycin and 3rd",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        220.9720916748047,
        399.0728454589844,
        234.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "generation cephalosporins are expensive, and would not be feasible to use as a first",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        233.9720916748047,
        291.9329528808594,
        247.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "line antibiotic treatment for NEC in low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        258.49072265625,
        231.48292541503906,
        270.480712890625
      ],
      "text": "5.7.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        274.1453857421875,
        399.1727600097656,
        287.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "NEC is a serious disease characterized by varying degrees of mucosal necrosis, seen",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        287.1453857421875,
        399.06298828125,
        300.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "predominantly in premature infants. The underlying pathogenesis remains unclear",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        300.1453857421875,
        399.0529479980469,
        313.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "and pathogenic organisms are not isolated in many cases. Clustering of cases and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        313.1453857421875,
        339.5628662109375,
        326.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "outbreaks in nurseries suggest an infective component to its aetiology.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        326.1453857421875,
        399.121337890625,
        339.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "Four studies were found directly comparing antibiotic regimens in NEC. One",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        339.1453857421875,
        399.07293701171875,
        352.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "non-concurrent cohort study from Belgium was excluded as the effect of the addition",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        352.1453857421875,
        399.04278564453125,
        365.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "of metronidazole to an existing antibiotic regimen could not be separated from other",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        365.1453857421875,
        399.0829162597656,
        378.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous modifications to an existing management protocol (e.g. earlier and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        378.1453857421875,
        399.11297607421875,
        391.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "different surgical approaches, changes in anaesthesia, and modification of intensive",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        391.1453857421875,
        171.53294372558594,
        404.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "care management routines).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        404.1453857421875,
        399.1513977050781,
        417.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "One study included 46 cases of NEC in 1982–3 treated with ampicillin and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        417.1453857421875,
        399.07305908203125,
        430.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "gentamicin, and 44 cases in 1984–5 treated with vancomycin and ceftriaxone",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        430.1453857421875,
        399.0229797363281,
        443.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "[Scheifele, 1987]. There were no statistical differences in any measured outcomes for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        443.1453857421875,
        399.0927734375,
        456.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "infants of birth weight > 2200g and complications were infrequent in both groups.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        456.1453857421875,
        399.07275390625,
        469.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "For infants < 2200g, those treated with Vancomycin demonstrated statistically lower",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        469.0154113769531,
        399.11676025390625,
        482.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "p p p rates of death (  = 0.048), need for surgery (  = 0.04), culture positive peritonitis (  =",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        482.0154113769531,
        399.1125793457031,
        495.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "p 0.01), and major complications (  = 0.004): these included peritonitis, strictures, feed",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        495.1453857421875,
        399.012939453125,
        508.6354064941406
      ],
      "text": "intolerance, and recurrent NEC and thrombocytopenia. The quality of evidence was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        508.1453857421875,
        133.4028778076172,
        521.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "graded as very low.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        521.1453857421875,
        399.1014709472656,
        534.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "One RCT allocated 42 premature infants with radiographically confirmed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        534.1453857421875,
        399.0928039550781,
        547.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "NEC to receive IV ampicillin and gentamicin or to receive ampicillin, gentamicin,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        547.1453857421875,
        399.0829162597656,
        560.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "and clindamycin [Faix, 1998]. This study found an increased rate of complicating",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        560.1453857421875,
        399.10272216796875,
        573.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "strictures in the clindamycin group (NNT harm 3, 95% CI 2 to 13) with a consequently",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        573.1453857421875,
        399.0329895019531,
        586.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "longer time needed to restart feeds (8.4 days versus 22.3). There were no significant",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        586.1453857421875,
        399.07293701171875,
        599.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "differences in rates of death or in incidence of gangrene/perforation. The study was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        599.1453857421875,
        399.102783203125,
        612.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "terminated early due to significantly higher rates of strictures in the clindamycin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        258.875,
        611.9254150390625,
        351.4949035644531,
        625.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.5",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        612.1453857421875,
        356.7029113769531,
        625.6353759765625
      ],
      "text": "group. The quality of evidence was graded as low ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4781036376953,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.56910705566406,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "31",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}